Data (everything in data/ and gold/)
------------------------------------

The text of Pliny the Elder, Natural History, tr. J. Bostock and H. T. Riley (1855), comes from
the Perseus Digital Library (Tufts University) under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike
3.0 United States licence (CC BY-SA 3.0 US). The source file, the extracted text, the claims, the
gold set and all derived results are shared under the same licence:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/us/

Third-party sources used for the results keep their own terms: World Flora Online Plant List
(plant names), MeSH from the U.S. National Library of Medicine (conditions), and Europe PMC
(paper titles and abstracts, cached in data/05_evidence/cache.json).
